WEBVTT

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.872
Good morning, Commander.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:12.969
Data.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.376
Interesting night?

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.848
I found it
extremely interesting.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.578
The lateral sensor arrays

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.779
ran three separate
spectral analyses

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.117
on the Alawanir Nebula

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.952
on three distinct frequencies.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.321
I'm sorry I missed it.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.656
I will have the report
sent to you, sir.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.094
We are still on course
for the Gariman Sector.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.497
Our speed is warp six.
ETA: 1300 hours.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.626
Sick Bay reported
one minor injury

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.762
in the exobiology department
at 0420 hours.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.102
Very well.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.700
Isn't Lieutenant Worf scheduled
to replace Ensign Torigan?

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.471
Yes, sir.
I was not informed

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.502
of any change
in the duty roster.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.275
He's never late.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.009
Riker to Lieutenant Worf.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.618
Computer,
locate Lieutenant Worf.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:58.419
Lieutenant Worf
is in his quarters.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:00:59.755
Something's wrong.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.784
Mr. Data, you have the Bridge.

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:05.423
Security team, meet me on
deck seven, section 25-baker.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.524
Aye, sir.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.972
Computer, override security lock
on this door.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:23.346
Authorization:
Riker-alpha-six-zero.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:36.328
Torva... Luk... Do...

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.990
Shell.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:40.965
Torva...

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.331
Worf...

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.233
what the hell are you doing?

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:22.340
Space, the final frontier.

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:26.209
These are the voyages
of the Starship Enterprise.

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.214
Its continuing mission...

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:32.184
to explore strange new worlds

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:36.655
to seek out new life
and new civilizations

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:41.149
to boldly go
where no one has gone before.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.577
Enter.

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:56.562
Captain...

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:01.397
On your feet, Lieutenant.

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:06.368
Sir.

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:09.313
Mr. Worf, your personal affairs
are strictly your own concern

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:11.874
until they interfere
with the operation of this ship.

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:13.647
You have now crossed that line.

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:17.645
As your Captain, I want to know
exactly what is going on.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.521
It is difficult to explain.

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:21.288
Try.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:24.524
Ever since I returned
from the Carraya System

00:04:24.564 --> 00:04:27.362
I have felt... empty.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.961
Does this have something to do
with the Klingons you rescued

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:32.971
from Carraya IV?

00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:34.974
They were young.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:37.566
They knew nothing
of their heritage

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.511
so while I was there,
I tried to teach them...

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:42.980
teach them about their people

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:44.516
their culture.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.519
I told them our ancient stories

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:50.147
instructed them in our customs

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:51.554
explained our beliefs.

00:04:51.591 --> 00:04:53.991
And then I told them
about Kahless...

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:56.755
how he had united our people
long ago

00:04:56.796 --> 00:04:58.991
how he gave us
strength and honor

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:01.726
and how he promised
to return one day

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:03.099
and lead us again.

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:12.404
Is that what you're doing here?

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:14.709
Trying to recapture
those feelings?

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:16.044
Yes.

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:18.846
I was trying to summon
a vision of Kahless.

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.785
It's a pity that you
didn't try the holodeck

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.617
instead of setting fire
to your quarters.

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:25.818
Using the holodeck
would not have been appropriate.

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:29.157
Everything had to be real
if Kahless were to appear.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.128
But all this...

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:35.532
is for nothing.

00:05:35.568 --> 00:05:37.832
He did not come to me.

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:43.967
I gave Toq and the others
a belief in Sto-Vo-Kor...

00:05:44.077 --> 00:05:46.477
the life which lies
beyond this life

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:48.844
where Kahless awaits us.

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:51.441
When I saw the power
of their beliefs

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:54.681
I began to question
the strength of my own

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:59.658
and I found it... wanting.

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:03.526
Have you lost your faith
in Sto-Vo-Kor?

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:04.860
To lose something

00:06:04.897 --> 00:06:06.797
one must first possess it.

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.291
I am not sure
I ever had a true belief.

00:06:16.476 --> 00:06:19.070
But I should not have allowed it
to interfere with my duties.

00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:20.101
My behavior has been...

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:21.704
Inexcusable.

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:25.216
And understandable.

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:27.378
It may be
that what you are looking for

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.581
cannot be found
here on the Enterprise.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.249
Perhaps you need
to immerse yourself

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:35.692
in Klingon beliefs

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:37.423
in order to discover

00:06:37.463 --> 00:06:39.931
if they can hold
any truths for you.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.525
Is there...
something you can do?

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:45.628
Is there somewhere you could go

00:06:45.671 --> 00:06:48.765
to explore your faith
more fully?

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.541
Boreth.

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:55.672
The followers of Kahless
await his return there.

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:58.445
To Klingons, there is
no more sacred place.

00:06:58.484 --> 00:07:03.421
Mmm. And Boreth is only 12 days
from here by shuttle.

00:07:05.391 --> 00:07:08.383
As of this moment, Mr. Worf,
you are on leave.

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:10.453
Thank you, sir.

00:07:10.496 --> 00:07:13.863
But when you set foot
on this ship again

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.869
I expect you
to perform your duties

00:07:16.903 --> 00:07:18.530
like a Starfleet officer.

00:07:18.571 --> 00:07:19.731
Yes, sir.

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:28.207
And, Mr. Worf...

00:07:28.247 --> 00:07:31.375
I hope you find
what you're looking for.

00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:32.975
Thank you, sir.

00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:52.605
Torva... Luk... Do... Shell.

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:55.971
Torva... Luk...

00:07:56.008 --> 00:07:58.841
Do... Shell.

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:05.113
Torva... Luk... Do... Shell.

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:11.112
Torva... Luk...
Do... Shell.

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:14.388
Torva... Luk... Do...

00:08:14.427 --> 00:08:16.292
Kahless!

00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:17.489
I see Kahless!

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:21.466
He is standing before me
with a sword.

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:23.093
He wants something.

00:08:23.135 --> 00:08:25.933
Me.

00:08:26.005 --> 00:08:28.098
He wants me.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.541
He wants me to go with him!

00:08:32.778 --> 00:08:36.111
It is a powerful vision
you have had, Divok.

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:39.743
Kahless wants you to join him
in Sto-Vo-Kor.

00:08:39.785 --> 00:08:42.583
You're only 19,
and yet your place

00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:45.614
among the honored dead
is already secure.

00:08:45.658 --> 00:08:47.751
Take him back to his chamber.

00:08:47.793 --> 00:08:49.192
Let him sleep.

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:05.742
You're leaving us?

00:09:05.778 --> 00:09:08.440
It has been ten days, Koroth.

00:09:08.481 --> 00:09:10.449
I have had no visions.

00:09:10.483 --> 00:09:12.678
I have received no insight.

00:09:12.718 --> 00:09:15.050
There is nothing here for me.

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:20.454
What is the story
of the promise, Worf?

00:09:23.229 --> 00:09:25.561
When Kahless
had united our people

00:09:25.598 --> 00:09:27.725
and gave them the laws of honor

00:09:27.767 --> 00:09:29.860
he saw that his work was done

00:09:29.902 --> 00:09:32.427
so, one night, he gathered
his belongings

00:09:32.471 --> 00:09:35.031
and departed
for the edge of the city

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:36.200
to say good-bye.

00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:37.573
The people wept.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.737
They did not want him to go.

00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:44.573
Then Kahless said,
"You are Klingons.

00:09:44.617 --> 00:09:47.450
"You need no one but yourselves.

00:09:47.486 --> 00:09:50.455
"I will go now to Sto-Vo-Kor

00:09:50.489 --> 00:09:53.856
but I promise one day
I will return."

00:09:53.893 --> 00:09:57.624
Then Kahless pointed
to a star in the sky

00:09:57.663 --> 00:10:03.966
and said, "Look for me there
on that point of light."

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.971
So, here we are...

00:10:07.006 --> 00:10:11.807
on a world circling
that distant point of light.

00:10:13.479 --> 00:10:17.074
It has been 15 centuries
since he made that promise

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:19.243
and still we wait.

00:10:19.285 --> 00:10:23.415
What are ten days
in the life of one Klingon

00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:25.253
compared to that?

00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:30.251
Is the son of Mogh
really so easily discouraged?

00:10:30.296 --> 00:10:32.992
You came to us seeking answers

00:10:33.099 --> 00:10:37.433
but this is a place
of questions.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:40.769
Open your heart to Kahless.

00:10:40.806 --> 00:10:43.274
Ask him your questions

00:10:43.309 --> 00:10:45.277
let him speak to you

00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:48.803
with your mind unclouded
by doubt or hesitation.

00:10:48.848 --> 00:10:52.614
Only then can you find
what you are looking for.

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:54.950
If you cannot do that

00:10:54.987 --> 00:11:00.425
then perhaps you should
return to your starship.

00:11:13.673 --> 00:11:18.838
... Luk... Do... Shell.

00:11:18.878 --> 00:11:25.408
Torva... Luk... Do... Shell.

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:28.181
Torva... Luk...

00:11:35.394 --> 00:11:37.294
I see Kahless.

00:12:02.888 --> 00:12:04.879
You are real.

00:12:09.428 --> 00:12:12.556
I am Kahless

00:12:12.598 --> 00:12:15.829
and I have returned.

00:12:37.053 --> 00:12:38.543
What are you doing?

00:12:41.924 --> 00:12:43.915
Who are you?

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.655
It is Kahless.

00:12:50.533 --> 00:12:53.001
I have returned.

00:12:53.069 --> 00:12:56.197
You doubt me.

00:12:56.239 --> 00:13:01.836
Who here knows the story
of how this sword was forged?

00:13:01.878 --> 00:13:03.175
No one knows.

00:13:03.212 --> 00:13:05.840
It is not written
in the sacred texts.

00:13:08.918 --> 00:13:12.046
I went into the mountains

00:13:12.088 --> 00:13:15.524
all the way to the volcano
at Kri'stak.

00:13:15.558 --> 00:13:18.527
There I cut off
a lock of my hair

00:13:18.561 --> 00:13:22.497
and thrust it
into the river of molten rock

00:13:22.531 --> 00:13:25.056
that poured from the summit.

00:13:25.101 --> 00:13:27.262
The hair began to burn.

00:13:27.303 --> 00:13:31.205
Then I plunged it
into the lake of Lusor

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:35.904
and twisted it into this sword.

00:13:35.945 --> 00:13:40.075
And after I used it
to kill Molor

00:13:40.116 --> 00:13:42.584
I gave it a name...

00:13:42.618 --> 00:13:45.086
bat'leth...

00:13:45.121 --> 00:13:47.749
the sword of honor.

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.088
You know.

00:13:50.126 --> 00:13:52.094
The story of the sword

00:13:52.128 --> 00:13:54.528
is known only
to the high clerics.

00:13:54.563 --> 00:13:56.394
It was never written down

00:13:56.432 --> 00:14:00.698
so that if he returned,
we could be sure it was Kahless.

00:14:00.736 --> 00:14:02.203
I have returned

00:14:02.238 --> 00:14:05.833
because there is
a great need in my people.

00:14:05.875 --> 00:14:10.209
They fight amongst themselves
in petty wars

00:14:10.246 --> 00:14:13.113
that corrupt the glory
of the Klingon spirit.

00:14:13.149 --> 00:14:16.209
They have lost their way...

00:14:16.252 --> 00:14:18.618
but it is not too late.

00:14:18.654 --> 00:14:21.282
I have returned

00:14:21.324 --> 00:14:25.260
and I will lead my people again.

00:14:26.362 --> 00:14:31.459
Vorch-doh-baghk, Kahless.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:36.904
Vorch-doh-baghk,
Kahless.

00:14:36.939 --> 00:14:41.308
Vorch-doh-baghk, Kahless.

00:14:48.351 --> 00:14:51.843
What is it you are doing?

00:14:53.689 --> 00:14:55.680
I was getting my tricorder.

00:14:55.725 --> 00:14:57.750
Tricorder?

00:14:57.793 --> 00:14:59.488
Is it a weapon?

00:14:59.528 --> 00:15:01.996
No. No. It is a tool.

00:15:02.031 --> 00:15:04.795
I intended to use it
to see if...

00:15:04.834 --> 00:15:07.166
To see if I was real.

00:15:09.338 --> 00:15:10.930
Proceed.

00:15:11.007 --> 00:15:13.237
Use your tricorder.

00:15:25.187 --> 00:15:26.814
Well?

00:15:28.657 --> 00:15:30.249
You are Klingon.

00:15:30.292 --> 00:15:33.090
What else could I be?

00:15:33.129 --> 00:15:35.063
There are many possibilities...

00:15:35.097 --> 00:15:38.692
a shape-shifter,
a holographic projection.

00:15:38.734 --> 00:15:40.964
So, you are a skeptic, Worf.

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:42.537
I like that.

00:15:42.571 --> 00:15:45.904
How do you know my name?

00:15:45.941 --> 00:15:48.409
We have met before.

00:15:48.444 --> 00:15:53.381
I appeared to you in a vision
in the caves of No'Mat.

00:15:53.416 --> 00:15:55.907
You were just a child then.

00:15:55.951 --> 00:15:59.443
I told you that you
would do something

00:15:59.488 --> 00:16:02.924
that no Klingon
had ever done before.

00:16:03.025 --> 00:16:09.692
You still do not believe
it is me, do you, Worf?

00:16:09.732 --> 00:16:12.098
I want to believe.

00:16:15.738 --> 00:16:18.332
That is a beginning.

00:16:33.789 --> 00:16:35.347
Gowron is the leader
of the Council.

00:16:35.391 --> 00:16:37.052
He commands
the entire defense force.

00:16:37.093 --> 00:16:38.890
If he chooses to oppose you...

00:16:38.928 --> 00:16:40.225
Do not worry.

00:16:40.262 --> 00:16:43.959
We are on the threshold
of a new era for our people.

00:16:44.066 --> 00:16:46.398
Klingons
from all over the Empire

00:16:46.435 --> 00:16:48.164
will flock to my banner.

00:16:50.039 --> 00:16:52.405
And yet...

00:16:52.441 --> 00:16:57.708
something still weighs heavy
on the brow of the son of Mogh.

00:16:57.746 --> 00:17:01.113
Are you contemplating
yet another question for me?

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:04.483
After three days,
I am beginning to wonder

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:07.489
if you know
how to do anything else.

00:17:07.523 --> 00:17:09.923
Questions are
the beginning of wisdom

00:17:09.992 --> 00:17:11.857
the mark of a true warrior.

00:17:11.894 --> 00:17:15.330
Do not forget that a leader
need not answer questions

00:17:15.364 --> 00:17:16.524
of those he leads.

00:17:16.565 --> 00:17:19.056
It is enough
that he says to do a thing

00:17:19.101 --> 00:17:20.398
and they will do it.

00:17:20.436 --> 00:17:22.666
If he says to run, they run.

00:17:22.705 --> 00:17:25.333
If he says to fight, they fight.

00:17:25.374 --> 00:17:28.366
If he says to die...

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.275
they die.

00:17:33.415 --> 00:17:37.215
If the commander
is worthy of that trust.

00:18:33.242 --> 00:18:35.369
What is wrong?

00:18:35.411 --> 00:18:41.281
Is there only anger
and bloodlust in your souls?

00:18:41.317 --> 00:18:45.651
Is that all that is left
in the Klingon heart?

00:18:45.688 --> 00:18:49.146
We do not fight
merely to spill blood

00:18:49.191 --> 00:18:52.354
but to enrich the spirit.

00:18:52.394 --> 00:18:53.952
Look at us...

00:18:53.996 --> 00:18:57.659
two warriors locked in battle

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.134
fighting for honor!

00:19:00.169 --> 00:19:04.731
How can you not sing
for all to hear

00:19:04.773 --> 00:19:07.435
"We are Klingons!"

00:19:09.778 --> 00:19:12.713
Yes.

00:19:12.748 --> 00:19:14.181
Let it out.

00:19:14.216 --> 00:19:17.276
Let the joy in your heart
be heard.

00:19:17.319 --> 00:19:22.222
We are Klingon!
We are Klingon.

00:19:23.926 --> 00:19:25.826
We are Klingons!

00:19:25.861 --> 00:19:30.025
We are Klingons!
We are Klingons!

00:19:30.065 --> 00:19:32.465
We are Klingons!

00:19:32.501 --> 00:19:37.268
We are Klingons!
We are Klingons!

00:19:37.306 --> 00:19:38.534
We are Klingons!

00:19:42.645 --> 00:19:46.342
Captain's Log, Stardate 46852.2.

00:19:46.382 --> 00:19:49.442
The Enterprise is to proceed
directly to the planet Boreth

00:19:49.485 --> 00:19:53.216
to take aboard
a very unusual guest.

00:19:53.255 --> 00:19:56.315
Did you take
any other tricorder readings...

00:19:56.359 --> 00:19:59.624
an anatomical profile
or a neurophysiology scan?

00:19:59.662 --> 00:20:00.959
No.

00:20:01.063 --> 00:20:02.894
It's going to be very difficult

00:20:02.932 --> 00:20:05.662
to eliminate any possibilities
at this point.

00:20:05.701 --> 00:20:08.602
He may be a coalescent being
taking Klingon form

00:20:08.637 --> 00:20:09.661
or a bioreplicant

00:20:09.705 --> 00:20:12.640
or even a Klingon
who has been surgically altered

00:20:12.675 --> 00:20:13.835
to look like Kahless.

00:20:13.876 --> 00:20:15.741
There is another possibility.

00:20:16.746 --> 00:20:19.943
He could be the real Kahless.

00:20:19.982 --> 00:20:22.576
He may have actually
returned as he promised.

00:20:22.618 --> 00:20:24.677
The appearance of Kahless
in the lava caves

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.381
is consistent with the stories

00:20:26.422 --> 00:20:27.889
found in the Klingon
sacred texts.

00:20:27.923 --> 00:20:30.824
Worf, no offense,
but I have trouble believing

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:34.796
that the man that I escorted
from deck eight is supernatural.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.491
I did not say that he is.

00:20:36.532 --> 00:20:37.829
I merely think

00:20:37.867 --> 00:20:41.530
we should not completely
reject the possibility.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:44.869
Look, we have no reason
to rule out anything.

00:20:44.907 --> 00:20:46.238
We are not ordered

00:20:46.275 --> 00:20:49.142
to investigate
the origins of our guest

00:20:49.178 --> 00:20:51.544
nor to tell anyone
what they should believe.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:54.515
We are simply to transport
Kahless to the homeworld

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:57.542
and while he's here with us

00:20:57.586 --> 00:21:00.248
he will be treated
as an honored guest.

00:21:03.626 --> 00:21:05.355
Lieutenant.

00:21:08.731 --> 00:21:10.062
May I ask a question?

00:21:10.099 --> 00:21:13.557
In the absence of empirical
data, how will you determine

00:21:13.602 --> 00:21:16.162
whether or not
this is the real Kahless?

00:21:16.205 --> 00:21:18.105
It is not an empirical matter.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.109
It is a matter of... faith.

00:21:21.143 --> 00:21:22.735
Faith.

00:21:22.778 --> 00:21:26.305
Then you do believe
Kahless may have

00:21:26.348 --> 00:21:27.747
supernatural attributes.

00:21:27.783 --> 00:21:29.978
As an android,
I am unable to accept

00:21:30.019 --> 00:21:33.250
that which cannot be proven
through rational means.

00:21:33.289 --> 00:21:36.383
I would appreciate hearing
your insights on this matter.

00:21:36.425 --> 00:21:39.861
Perhaps some other time,
Commander.

00:21:39.895 --> 00:21:44.764
I... do not believe
I can provide much... insight

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:46.358
at this moment.

00:22:03.152 --> 00:22:04.676
Welcome aboard, Gowron.

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:07.211
Where is he, Picard?

00:22:08.324 --> 00:22:10.792
I assume that you
are referring to Kahless.

00:22:10.826 --> 00:22:13.158
I am referring
to the filthy pahtak

00:22:13.195 --> 00:22:14.594
who is using his name.

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:17.827
Well, the person in question

00:22:17.867 --> 00:22:20.131
is in his quarters
at the moment.

00:22:20.169 --> 00:22:22.831
What have you learned
about him so far?

00:22:22.872 --> 00:22:24.806
What kind of medical
analysis have you made?

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:26.967
Do you have any theories
about his true origin?

00:22:27.009 --> 00:22:28.237
We haven't done any analysis.

00:22:28.277 --> 00:22:30.973
What kind of fools do you have
working for you, Picard?

00:22:31.013 --> 00:22:33.481
The impostor's been aboard
for nearly a day.

00:22:33.516 --> 00:22:35.177
If you had wanted
to run tests on Kahless

00:22:35.217 --> 00:22:36.980
you should have sent
a Klingon ship for him.

00:22:37.086 --> 00:22:39.247
And have him begin spreading
his poisonous lies

00:22:39.288 --> 00:22:41.688
through a ship
of Ioyal Klingons? Never.

00:22:41.724 --> 00:22:42.816
If he really is an impostor

00:22:42.858 --> 00:22:44.382
then you have
nothing to worry about.

00:22:44.426 --> 00:22:46.519
Kahless has been dead
for 1,000 years

00:22:46.562 --> 00:22:48.757
but the idea of Kahless
is still alive.

00:22:48.797 --> 00:22:50.924
Have you ever fought
an idea, Picard?

00:22:50.966 --> 00:22:54.129
It has no weapon to destroy,
no body to kill.

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:58.368
The idea of Kahless' return
must be stopped here, now

00:22:58.407 --> 00:23:02.241
or it will travel
through the Empire like a wave

00:23:02.278 --> 00:23:05.577
and leave nothing
but destruction behind.

00:23:13.222 --> 00:23:16.157
So, Gowron has come on board
in order to test your claim.

00:23:16.192 --> 00:23:18.786
Gowron knows
that his days are nearly over.

00:23:18.827 --> 00:23:21.955
Now he comes crawling aboard
with some kind of test.

00:23:22.031 --> 00:23:24.625
We do not have to prove
anything to Gowron.

00:23:24.667 --> 00:23:25.759
What is this test?

00:23:25.801 --> 00:23:27.200
He has brought a knife
with him...

00:23:27.236 --> 00:23:29.431
a knife that is supposed
to be stained

00:23:29.471 --> 00:23:30.961
with the blood of Kahless.

00:23:31.073 --> 00:23:33.132
Gowron has brought
the Knife of Kirom?

00:23:33.175 --> 00:23:34.904
No one is permitted
to remove it

00:23:34.944 --> 00:23:36.172
from the sacred vault.

00:23:36.212 --> 00:23:38.544
Gowron does not care
about what is sacred.

00:23:38.581 --> 00:23:40.879
He wants to run
a genetic analysis

00:23:40.916 --> 00:23:43.441
on a sample of the blood,
and on you.

00:23:43.485 --> 00:23:46.386
That should tell us
if there is a biological match.

00:23:46.422 --> 00:23:47.753
Now, if you agree to the test

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:50.315
I will make the Enterprise
facilities available

00:23:50.359 --> 00:23:53.260
to ensure that it is conducted
impartially.

00:23:53.295 --> 00:23:57.698
Perhaps it is time
to settle the doubts

00:23:57.733 --> 00:24:01.635
of those
who still do not believe.

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:04.434
I will allow this test.

00:24:08.777 --> 00:24:11.041
There, that should do it.

00:24:12.948 --> 00:24:16.384
Computer, run
a genetic comparison

00:24:16.418 --> 00:24:18.386
on this blood sample

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:21.878
and the tissue
belonging to Kahless.

00:24:21.924 --> 00:24:24.358
The genetic patterns
are identical.

00:24:25.628 --> 00:24:27.220
But how?

00:24:27.263 --> 00:24:29.857
How can this be?

00:24:32.368 --> 00:24:34.336
It is true.

00:24:36.739 --> 00:24:39.435
Kahless has returned.

00:24:47.349 --> 00:24:50.716
Ah...

00:24:50.752 --> 00:24:51.980
I am sorry.

00:24:52.020 --> 00:24:54.318
Our replicators
do not do justice

00:24:54.356 --> 00:24:55.846
to Klingon warnog.

00:25:02.530 --> 00:25:05.328
It's been so long
since I have tasted

00:25:05.367 --> 00:25:06.925
any food or drink.

00:25:07.035 --> 00:25:10.368
There are many things
I have forgotten.

00:25:14.042 --> 00:25:15.373
Kahless...

00:25:18.046 --> 00:25:22.676
may I ask you about... death...

00:25:22.717 --> 00:25:24.651
and Sto-Vo-Kor?

00:25:24.686 --> 00:25:27.120
Tell me...

00:25:27.155 --> 00:25:29.851
what awaits us beyond this life?

00:25:31.359 --> 00:25:34.487
I do not have those answers.

00:25:34.529 --> 00:25:36.656
I am merely a traveler...

00:25:36.698 --> 00:25:39.428
someone who has journeyed
back and forth

00:25:39.467 --> 00:25:41.662
between this world and the next.

00:25:41.703 --> 00:25:43.330
While I am in this form

00:25:43.371 --> 00:25:45.862
I know only about this world.

00:25:47.041 --> 00:25:48.474
And there is

00:25:48.510 --> 00:25:51.206
much work for me to do
in this world.

00:25:51.246 --> 00:25:53.680
And you will be part of it,
Worf.

00:25:53.715 --> 00:25:55.114
Me?

00:25:55.150 --> 00:25:57.141
It was your purity of heart

00:25:57.185 --> 00:26:00.916
that summoned me
back from Sto-Vo-Kor

00:26:00.955 --> 00:26:02.252
and Koroth has told me

00:26:02.290 --> 00:26:04.281
about the respect
you have earned

00:26:04.325 --> 00:26:06.259
in the Federation
and the Empire.

00:26:06.294 --> 00:26:09.422
I want you to have
a place at my side

00:26:09.464 --> 00:26:12.433
as we restore honor
to our people.

00:26:14.502 --> 00:26:19.667
Let me tell you about
this new Empire we will forge.

00:26:23.178 --> 00:26:25.305
It will be glorious!

00:26:25.346 --> 00:26:26.779
It will be war!

00:26:29.517 --> 00:26:31.382
You're not a fool, Worf.

00:26:31.419 --> 00:26:34.820
Do you really think
that every Klingon in the Empire

00:26:34.856 --> 00:26:37.825
will bend his knee
and grovel before this man

00:26:37.859 --> 00:26:40.419
just because Koroth
says he is Kahless?

00:26:40.462 --> 00:26:42.692
He is Kahless.

00:26:44.199 --> 00:26:45.962
Your own test proved it.

00:26:46.034 --> 00:26:49.094
I will not hand over
the Empire to Koroth

00:26:49.137 --> 00:26:50.661
because of one test.

00:26:50.705 --> 00:26:52.434
It is not Koroth, it is...

00:26:52.474 --> 00:26:54.271
Of course, it is Koroth!

00:26:54.309 --> 00:26:56.106
Open your eyes!

00:26:56.144 --> 00:27:00.444
Koroth and the other guardians
have always opposed me.

00:27:00.482 --> 00:27:02.643
This is nothing more than a ploy

00:27:02.684 --> 00:27:04.777
for them
to finally seize power.

00:27:04.819 --> 00:27:08.380
Even now, there are warriors
on my own ship

00:27:08.423 --> 00:27:10.448
who want to see Kahless.

00:27:10.492 --> 00:27:13.461
There are others who believe
he is an impostor.

00:27:13.495 --> 00:27:15.929
The divisions
are already forming.

00:27:15.997 --> 00:27:18.727
But it does not have
to be this way.

00:27:18.766 --> 00:27:22.293
We could all join together
and welcome Kahless

00:27:22.337 --> 00:27:23.929
as a united people.

00:27:24.005 --> 00:27:25.632
Don't you see?

00:27:25.673 --> 00:27:29.109
This is exactly why
they want you to join them

00:27:29.143 --> 00:27:32.135
because your brother
sits on the Council

00:27:32.180 --> 00:27:35.911
and your voice
carries weight in the Empire.

00:27:35.950 --> 00:27:40.080
They want you to influence
others to follow them.

00:27:40.121 --> 00:27:41.816
Worf...

00:27:41.856 --> 00:27:44.950
we fought together once,
side by side

00:27:45.059 --> 00:27:48.586
to keep the Empire
from being torn apart.

00:27:48.630 --> 00:27:50.154
Will you stand by

00:27:50.198 --> 00:27:52.428
and let these impostors destroy

00:27:52.467 --> 00:27:55.800
all that we fought so hard
to protect?

00:27:59.641 --> 00:28:01.939
Renounce him, Worf.

00:28:01.976 --> 00:28:03.500
Stand with me

00:28:03.545 --> 00:28:07.777
and we can hold the Empire...

00:28:07.815 --> 00:28:09.282
together.

00:28:11.986 --> 00:28:13.613
You do not understand.

00:28:13.655 --> 00:28:15.452
Kahless is our future.

00:28:15.490 --> 00:28:16.923
Only with his help

00:28:16.991 --> 00:28:20.927
can we revive the pure warriors
within ourselves.

00:28:20.995 --> 00:28:22.792
Listen to him, Gowron.

00:28:22.830 --> 00:28:23.922
Open your heart.

00:28:23.998 --> 00:28:25.363
Hear his words.

00:28:25.400 --> 00:28:30.463
He will restore your faith
as he has restored mine.

00:28:30.505 --> 00:28:33.633
Give him a chance to lift
your spirit

00:28:33.675 --> 00:28:35.540
and cleanse your heart

00:28:35.577 --> 00:28:38.011
before you take up arms.

00:28:52.794 --> 00:28:54.261
Koroth...

00:28:54.295 --> 00:28:56.661
I see
that not all fools die young.

00:28:58.166 --> 00:29:00.396
Kahless.

00:29:05.306 --> 00:29:09.834
Kahless, may I present Gowron,
leader of the High Council.

00:29:09.877 --> 00:29:12.607
Kahless.

00:29:17.819 --> 00:29:23.451
Long ago, a storm was heading
toward the city of Quin'lat.

00:29:23.491 --> 00:29:26.619
The people sought protection
within the walls...

00:29:26.661 --> 00:29:29.323
all except one man
who remained outside.

00:29:29.364 --> 00:29:32.765
I went to him and asked
what he was doing.

00:29:32.800 --> 00:29:35.928
"I am not afraid," he said.

00:29:36.037 --> 00:29:40.633
"I will not hide my face
behind stone and mortar.

00:29:40.675 --> 00:29:45.635
I will stand before the wind
and make it respect me."

00:29:45.680 --> 00:29:49.172
I honored his choice
and went inside.

00:29:49.217 --> 00:29:52.084
The next day, the storm came

00:29:52.120 --> 00:29:55.647
and the man was killed.

00:29:55.690 --> 00:30:01.151
The wind
does not respect a fool.

00:30:01.195 --> 00:30:05.393
Do not stand before the wind,
Gowron.

00:30:05.433 --> 00:30:08.493
What was his name?

00:30:10.605 --> 00:30:12.505
What?

00:30:12.540 --> 00:30:14.440
If you were really there

00:30:14.475 --> 00:30:16.841
you should be able to tell us

00:30:16.878 --> 00:30:19.608
the name of the man
outside the walls.

00:30:19.647 --> 00:30:22.343
Describe him to us.

00:30:22.383 --> 00:30:24.851
What was he wearing?

00:30:24.886 --> 00:30:27.514
How tall was he?

00:30:27.555 --> 00:30:29.648
What color were his eyes?!

00:30:29.691 --> 00:30:32.683
I do not remember.

00:30:32.727 --> 00:30:36.356
It was long ago
and in another lifetime.

00:30:36.397 --> 00:30:38.991
What matters is I have returned

00:30:39.067 --> 00:30:42.366
to restore faith and hope
to my people

00:30:42.403 --> 00:30:45.702
to lead them back
to the way of honor

00:30:45.740 --> 00:30:48.208
and the glory
that once was theirs

00:30:48.242 --> 00:30:50.210
and can be again.

00:30:50.244 --> 00:30:53.008
Is that
what you oppose, Gowron?

00:30:53.114 --> 00:30:55.480
I oppose you.

00:30:55.516 --> 00:30:57.177
I say you are not Kahless.

00:30:58.386 --> 00:31:00.411
And I will not

00:31:00.455 --> 00:31:06.325
bend my knee to you...
as long as I can draw breath...

00:31:06.360 --> 00:31:08.692
or pick up a blade.

00:31:18.039 --> 00:31:19.301
No!

00:31:19.340 --> 00:31:19.931
Koroth!

00:31:32.987 --> 00:31:35.717
Good try, Gowron,
but not enough.

00:31:49.437 --> 00:31:52.429
You have no joy, Gowron.

00:31:52.473 --> 00:31:55.203
Is your heart so full
of mistrust and suspicion

00:31:55.243 --> 00:31:57.006
that you've forgotten
what it means

00:31:57.111 --> 00:31:58.373
to be truly Klingon?

00:32:08.356 --> 00:32:09.948
Kahless...

00:32:10.024 --> 00:32:13.016
the greatest warrior
of them all.

00:32:27.541 --> 00:32:29.133
Everything will be all right.

00:32:29.176 --> 00:32:30.234
We will say that...

00:32:30.277 --> 00:32:32.404
that Gowron used
a dishonorable tactic

00:32:32.446 --> 00:32:33.879
in his fight with Kahless.

00:32:33.914 --> 00:32:34.881
That he cheated.

00:32:34.915 --> 00:32:36.075
That is a lie.
He did not...

00:32:36.117 --> 00:32:37.982
We do not need to hear any more
from the son of Mogh.

00:32:38.085 --> 00:32:39.245
None of this would
have happened

00:32:39.286 --> 00:32:40.651
if you had not brought
them together.

00:32:40.688 --> 00:32:41.655
I am Kahless.

00:32:41.689 --> 00:32:43.816
I am the strongest,
the bravest warrior.

00:32:43.858 --> 00:32:45.553
Do not think
about what happened.

00:32:45.593 --> 00:32:48.118
You must think of the future,
of the Empire.

00:32:48.162 --> 00:32:50.255
There is no future here

00:32:50.297 --> 00:32:53.130
no glorious new era
for our people.

00:32:53.167 --> 00:32:55.328
Gowron was right.

00:32:55.369 --> 00:32:58.497
You did not know the name
of the man who faced the storm.

00:32:58.539 --> 00:33:01.440
You do not even know
what real warnog tastes like

00:33:01.475 --> 00:33:03.340
and you certainly are not
the greatest warrior of all.

00:33:03.377 --> 00:33:06.608
Whoever you are,
you are not Kahless.

00:33:06.647 --> 00:33:08.581
You have said enough.

00:33:08.616 --> 00:33:10.106
Now, get out!

00:33:10.151 --> 00:33:12.176
You are using
the name of Kahless

00:33:12.219 --> 00:33:13.652
for some twisted game.

00:33:13.687 --> 00:33:16.087
For that alone, you should die

00:33:16.123 --> 00:33:18.216
and if you do not tell me
what you have done

00:33:18.259 --> 00:33:19.590
I will kill you right here!

00:33:23.697 --> 00:33:25.961
Problems with your memory

00:33:26.033 --> 00:33:29.662
are the result
of the way you returned.

00:33:29.703 --> 00:33:32.228
What do you mean?

00:33:32.273 --> 00:33:33.467
We, the guardians

00:33:33.507 --> 00:33:36.601
have been awaiting your return
for centuries

00:33:36.644 --> 00:33:39.169
but we did not have
the technology

00:33:39.213 --> 00:33:41.204
to bring you back until now.

00:33:41.248 --> 00:33:43.978
We were able to use
an organic sample

00:33:44.051 --> 00:33:47.282
of the first Kahless
to give you life.

00:33:47.321 --> 00:33:48.879
The first Kahless?

00:33:48.923 --> 00:33:50.481
A clone.

00:33:55.496 --> 00:33:58.090
He is a clone.

00:33:58.132 --> 00:34:01.124
What is a clone?

00:34:01.168 --> 00:34:03.568
A being created in a laboratory

00:34:03.604 --> 00:34:07.062
by using genetic material
from another being.

00:34:07.108 --> 00:34:08.939
You are a copy, a fraud!

00:34:09.043 --> 00:34:10.874
You are not just a copy.

00:34:10.911 --> 00:34:13.607
We gave you more
than the body of Kahless.

00:34:13.647 --> 00:34:15.274
We found a way

00:34:15.316 --> 00:34:18.717
to imprint specific information
in your neurosynaptic patterns.

00:34:18.752 --> 00:34:20.947
We gave you memories,
and not just any memories.

00:34:21.055 --> 00:34:23.922
We gave you the experiences
of Kahless

00:34:23.958 --> 00:34:26.153
as written in the sacred texts.

00:34:26.193 --> 00:34:27.558
So...

00:34:27.595 --> 00:34:31.895
I did not do any of the things
that I remember.

00:34:31.932 --> 00:34:35.197
I was never
in the city of Quin'lat.

00:34:35.236 --> 00:34:38.694
I never went
to the Kri'stak Volcano.

00:34:38.739 --> 00:34:40.331
You were not awakened

00:34:40.374 --> 00:34:43.309
until we transported
you into the cave

00:34:43.344 --> 00:34:44.436
and you appeared to Worf.

00:34:44.478 --> 00:34:46.207
Before that, you were
unconscious in a laboratory

00:34:46.247 --> 00:34:48.147
where we accelerated
your growth

00:34:48.182 --> 00:34:50.742
corrected any genetic
anomalies that occurred

00:34:50.784 --> 00:34:53.150
gave you the wisdom
and memories that...

00:34:56.824 --> 00:35:01.591
They grew you in a test tube
like some kind of fungus

00:35:01.629 --> 00:35:04.655
and programmed you
like a machine.

00:35:04.698 --> 00:35:06.325
You are twisting the truth.

00:35:06.367 --> 00:35:08.130
You talk to me of truth.

00:35:08.169 --> 00:35:12.629
You who have brought to life
this lie and called it Kahless.

00:35:12.673 --> 00:35:13.935
It is not a lie.

00:35:14.041 --> 00:35:16.305
Genetically, he is Kahless

00:35:16.343 --> 00:35:19.141
and he is needed by our people.

00:35:19.180 --> 00:35:21.546
You know better than anyone
the corruption and dishonor

00:35:21.582 --> 00:35:22.879
that is destroying the Empire.

00:35:22.917 --> 00:35:24.179
They need him.

00:35:24.218 --> 00:35:26.243
They do not need a false god!

00:35:26.287 --> 00:35:28.346
How do you know
that this was not the way

00:35:28.389 --> 00:35:30.220
the prophecy was
to be fulfilled?

00:35:30.257 --> 00:35:32.589
Who is to say
that what we did was wrong?

00:35:32.626 --> 00:35:34.116
I am.

00:35:34.161 --> 00:35:37.756
I will not let this fraud
continue.

00:35:37.798 --> 00:35:38.890
Worf!

00:35:41.068 --> 00:35:43.559
You cannot tell Gowron of this.

00:35:43.604 --> 00:35:46.300
Do not give me orders,
Koroth.

00:35:46.340 --> 00:35:48.706
All right, but consider this.

00:35:48.742 --> 00:35:53.076
If you tell Gowron
what we have told you

00:35:53.113 --> 00:35:56.947
it will destroy him,
and with him

00:35:56.984 --> 00:36:02.854
the last chance
to restore hope to our people.

00:36:02.890 --> 00:36:05.154
It's your choice.

00:36:26.013 --> 00:36:29.881
They have been sitting here
for three hours, 17 minutes.

00:36:29.917 --> 00:36:32.442
They refused to return
to their ship

00:36:32.486 --> 00:36:34.647
with the rest of Gowron's men.

00:36:34.688 --> 00:36:39.057
They insisted upon waiting here
until they see Kahless again.

00:36:39.093 --> 00:36:41.653
Their faith appears
to be unaffected

00:36:41.695 --> 00:36:43.959
by his inability
to defeat Gowron.

00:36:44.031 --> 00:36:45.692
They still believe.

00:36:47.868 --> 00:36:49.233
Then they are fools.

00:36:49.269 --> 00:36:51.203
Does that mean you
no longer believe

00:36:51.238 --> 00:36:52.762
this is the real Kahless?

00:36:52.806 --> 00:36:54.068
Yes.

00:36:54.108 --> 00:36:56.599
I am curious.

00:36:56.643 --> 00:36:57.837
Do you still think

00:36:57.878 --> 00:37:00.312
the real Kahless
will return someday

00:37:00.347 --> 00:37:01.712
or has this experience

00:37:01.749 --> 00:37:03.410
only deepened
the spiritual crisis

00:37:03.450 --> 00:37:05.281
which originally
sent you to Boreth?

00:37:10.157 --> 00:37:12.352
I do not know.

00:37:12.393 --> 00:37:14.190
I understand your dilemma.

00:37:14.228 --> 00:37:16.662
I once had what could
be considered

00:37:16.697 --> 00:37:18.289
a crisis of the spirit.

00:37:18.332 --> 00:37:19.924
You?

00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:21.092
Yes.

00:37:21.135 --> 00:37:22.625
The Starfleet officers

00:37:22.669 --> 00:37:25.229
who first activated me
on Omicron Theta

00:37:25.272 --> 00:37:26.864
told me I was an android

00:37:26.907 --> 00:37:29.467
nothing more
than a sophisticated machine

00:37:29.510 --> 00:37:30.841
with human form.

00:37:30.878 --> 00:37:34.075
However, I realized
that if I were simply a machine

00:37:34.114 --> 00:37:36.708
I could never be anything else.

00:37:36.750 --> 00:37:40.186
I could never grow
beyond my programming.

00:37:40.220 --> 00:37:42.916
I found that difficult to accept

00:37:42.956 --> 00:37:46.323
so I chose to believe
that I was a person

00:37:46.360 --> 00:37:49.591
that I had the potential
to be more than a collection

00:37:49.630 --> 00:37:51.495
of circuits and subprocessors.

00:37:51.532 --> 00:37:54.399
It is a belief
which I still hold.

00:37:57.805 --> 00:38:01.172
How did you come
to your decision?

00:38:01.208 --> 00:38:06.646
I made... a leap of faith.

00:38:22.162 --> 00:38:27.623
The man who appeared to me
on Boreth is not Kahless.

00:38:27.668 --> 00:38:30.136
He is a clone.

00:38:30.170 --> 00:38:31.603
A clone?

00:38:31.638 --> 00:38:32.696
Yes.

00:38:32.739 --> 00:38:34.138
Did you really think

00:38:34.174 --> 00:38:36.938
you could get away
with this kind of fraud, Koroth?

00:38:36.977 --> 00:38:39.639
I will have you and this
abomination put to death.

00:38:39.680 --> 00:38:41.511
It does not matter, Gowron.

00:38:41.548 --> 00:38:44.881
You will still not be able
to stand against him.

00:38:44.918 --> 00:38:46.180
What?

00:38:46.220 --> 00:38:47.414
He's not real.

00:38:47.454 --> 00:38:48.944
You just said so.

00:38:48.989 --> 00:38:50.616
I said he was not Kahless

00:38:50.657 --> 00:38:52.682
but, in the minds of our people

00:38:52.726 --> 00:38:55.251
he can be
just as powerful as Kahless.

00:38:55.295 --> 00:38:57.889
Even now, two members
of your own crew

00:38:57.931 --> 00:39:01.594
are sitting on our holodeck
waiting for him to return.

00:39:01.635 --> 00:39:04.001
I do not care what they think.

00:39:04.037 --> 00:39:05.868
But they are not alone.

00:39:05.906 --> 00:39:07.464
Like many of our people

00:39:07.508 --> 00:39:09.772
they need something
to believe in

00:39:09.810 --> 00:39:13.075
just like I did... something
larger than themselves

00:39:13.113 --> 00:39:15.673
something that will give
their lives meaning.

00:39:15.716 --> 00:39:16.910
They need Kahless.

00:39:16.984 --> 00:39:19.418
But when they find out
the truth...

00:39:19.453 --> 00:39:21.318
It does not matter, Gowron.

00:39:21.355 --> 00:39:25.121
Despite the facts,
they will still believe.

00:39:25.158 --> 00:39:28.355
They will make a leap of faith

00:39:28.395 --> 00:39:30.920
and there will be
others just like them...

00:39:30.998 --> 00:39:32.590
not everyone, but enough

00:39:32.633 --> 00:39:34.897
to plunge the Empire
into civil war

00:39:34.935 --> 00:39:36.129
if you oppose them.

00:39:36.169 --> 00:39:37.466
What are you saying?

00:39:37.504 --> 00:39:40.029
That I should just hand over
the Empire?

00:39:40.073 --> 00:39:43.634
No, that would be unwise
as well.

00:39:43.677 --> 00:39:46.612
Then what are you proposing,
Worf?

00:39:48.715 --> 00:39:52.549
You were right about one thing,
Koroth.

00:39:52.586 --> 00:39:57.182
Our people are becoming
decadent and corrupt.

00:39:57.224 --> 00:39:59.954
They need moral leadership.

00:39:59.993 --> 00:40:04.157
Kahless can be that leader...

00:40:04.197 --> 00:40:05.596
as Emperor.

00:40:05.632 --> 00:40:08.965
There hasn't been an Emperor
in three centuries.

00:40:09.002 --> 00:40:12.802
The political power will remain
with the High Council.

00:40:12.839 --> 00:40:14.898
Kahless would be a figurehead

00:40:14.942 --> 00:40:18.309
but he will have the ability
to rally the people

00:40:18.345 --> 00:40:19.642
to lead by example

00:40:19.680 --> 00:40:21.978
to guide them
in spiritual matters.

00:40:22.049 --> 00:40:25.985
The title is meaningless
without the power to back it up.

00:40:26.019 --> 00:40:30.615
Real power comes
from within the heart.

00:40:30.657 --> 00:40:34.184
You would have the power
to mold the Klingon heart.

00:40:34.227 --> 00:40:36.957
You could return them
to honorable ways

00:40:36.997 --> 00:40:39.659
according to the original
teachings of Kahless

00:40:39.700 --> 00:40:40.928
which are within you.

00:40:40.968 --> 00:40:43.436
It would be a great challenge

00:40:43.470 --> 00:40:46.667
if you have
the courage to accept it.

00:40:46.707 --> 00:40:51.007
And what will we tell the people
about their new Emperor?

00:40:51.078 --> 00:40:54.377
That he appeared in a cave
or a laboratory?

00:40:54.414 --> 00:40:57.508
We will tell them the truth.

00:41:00.187 --> 00:41:02.485
All of the truth

00:41:02.522 --> 00:41:03.887
but we will tell them

00:41:03.924 --> 00:41:06.154
that, even if he is
not the real Kahless

00:41:06.193 --> 00:41:08.525
he is the rightful heir
to Kahless.

00:41:08.562 --> 00:41:11.725
And if I refuse to go along
with this?

00:41:11.765 --> 00:41:15.223
Then my brother and those
who support him on the Council

00:41:15.268 --> 00:41:17.566
will fight you,
and I will fight you

00:41:17.604 --> 00:41:21.597
and the Empire
will fall back into civil war.

00:41:23.877 --> 00:41:26.402
What do you say about this,
Koroth?

00:41:26.446 --> 00:41:30.576
What I say is unimportant.

00:41:35.222 --> 00:41:37.747
It is acceptable.

00:41:53.173 --> 00:41:54.435
Join with me, Gowron.

00:41:54.474 --> 00:42:00.504
Let us usher in
this new era together.

00:42:03.850 --> 00:42:10.517
Vorch-doh-baghk...

00:42:16.029 --> 00:42:18.589
Kahless.

00:42:27.207 --> 00:42:29.072
Farewell, Worf.

00:42:29.109 --> 00:42:31.669
Good-bye.

00:42:31.712 --> 00:42:33.145
What's wrong?

00:42:33.180 --> 00:42:37.082
You should be proud
of what you've accomplished.

00:42:42.889 --> 00:42:47.417
I went to Boreth
to find my faith.

00:42:47.461 --> 00:42:50.988
For a time, I thought I had

00:42:51.031 --> 00:42:54.762
but my heart is empty again.

00:42:54.801 --> 00:42:58.828
I do not know what to believe.

00:42:58.872 --> 00:43:02.330
You doubt the real Kahless
will return one day.

00:43:02.375 --> 00:43:05.105
You doubt that he is still
waiting for you

00:43:05.145 --> 00:43:08.205
in Sto-Vo-Kor.

00:43:11.184 --> 00:43:17.748
Kahless left us, all of us,
a powerful legacy

00:43:17.791 --> 00:43:22.728
a way of thinking and acting
that makes us Klingon.

00:43:22.763 --> 00:43:27.928
If his words hold wisdom
and his philosophy is honorable

00:43:27.968 --> 00:43:30.960
what does it matter
if he returns?

00:43:31.071 --> 00:43:36.668
What is important
is that we follow his teachings.

00:43:36.710 --> 00:43:39.338
Perhaps the words

00:43:39.379 --> 00:43:44.407
are more important
than the man.

00:43:44.451 --> 00:43:49.889
Qapla', son of Mogh.

00:43:53.493 --> 00:43:56.860
Qapla', Kahless.
